{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/VtBImbl67G8yFpHoFgvnug","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:45.184996+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/VtBImbl67G8yFpHoFgvnug","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/E8NicUD0iaWrlgRge6GD9zE2enjicnuvCwg40x0g1EIxR6OZwsvY46p4MAtC9wOXxtJlf335vxARdQORFibjyktPZLwATJoF7u8r12XhGEibvnjY/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>为帮助全国优秀大学生深入了解武汉大学“低空技术与经济”专业硕士项目，增进学生对低空经济这一国家战略性新兴产业的认知，武汉大学低空技术与经济项目中心计划于</span><strong><span>2026年7月</span></strong><span>举办校园开放日活动。本次开放日计划邀请100名左右的全国优秀大学生线下参与，根据实际报名情况适当调整。欢迎广大优秀学子踊跃报名！</span></p></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>一、活动概况</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>开放日当天，将邀请低空经济领域专家与校内教师共同参与，通过专业推介、学科前沿讲座、师生对话等环节，与学生面对面交流行业前沿动态与热点话题，帮助学生拓展行业视野，加深对学科发展方向和职业路径的理解，为未来的学术深造与职业发展提供参考方向。</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/E8NicUD0iaWrlHBugO4FeFL3a8Tsf1jcfXrK2U7p4vSjtzEKLcaqEVvQ6uTJnZexqpkT0XIEAxzDlHDNVkoBpSsE9ibsLInwhQIHzPibeyHwTho/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><p><strong><span>二、参与方式</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>（一）参与条件</span></strong></p><p><span>1．国内外大学的</span><strong><span>本科三年级在校生</span></strong><span>（2027届毕业生，含境外高校当年毕业学生）；</span></p><p><span>2．专业背景：测绘遥感、航空航天、自动化、计算机、电子信息、经济管理、法学、信息管理等；</span></p><p><span>3．学习成绩优异，对低空经济领域有浓厚兴趣，有较强科研潜力。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><strong><span>（二）报名材料</span></strong></p><p><span>学生申请参加开放日活动需提供以下材料：</span></p><p><span>1．</span><strong><span>身份证正反面扫描件</span></strong><span>；</span></p><p><span>2．</span><strong><span>个人简历</span></strong><span>；</span></p><p><span>3．</span><strong><span>个人陈述</span></strong><span>（包括但不限于学习与工作经历、相关科研工作、发表的主要学术论文和著作、何时何地何原因受过何种奖励或处分、担任学校干部或社会实践经历，以及对低空经济的认知及学习愿望等）；</span></p><p><span>4．</span><strong><span>前五或前六学期所有课程成绩的本科成绩单及专业成绩排名证明</span></strong><span>（同年级所在专业排名），</span><strong><span>须加盖学院教务部门公章</span></strong><span>；</span></p><p><span>5．</span><strong><span>外语水平证明材料</span></strong><span>（国家英语四、六级考试成绩或TOEFL/GRE/GMAT/IELTS成绩等）；</span></p><p><span>6．</span><strong><span>其他体现自身学术水平的代表性学术论文、专利、出版物或原创性成果，其它各类证书等</span></strong><span>。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><strong><span>（三）报名方式</span></strong></p><p><span>有意参加开放日的考生，可于7月9日前，扫描下方二维码申请报名，并将相应证明材料以“证明材料名称+申请人姓名”命名发送至 </span><strong><span>yesai_@whu.edu.cn</span></strong><span> 。中心将对申请材料进行审核，依据报名条件择优确定入选名单。入选结果将通过邮件或电话等方式告知，请各位同学保持电子邮箱和手机通信畅通。</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/E8NicUD0iaWrkacDtfkhZeafByHkpYJLkD4lCWn60KLrGlplo7B4ezN1hIuOO6VODDjM4iclnyvbrl0kP6C0uveNEXuIrRaLmnU8Wze8CRcul4/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>三、联系方式</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>武汉大学低空技术与经济项目中心</span></p><p><span>咨询电话：</span><strong><span>027-68778780</span></strong></p><p><span>招生QQ群：</span><strong><span>876621700</span></strong></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>武汉大学低空技术与经济项目中心</span></p><p><span>2026年6月26日</span></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><span>来源丨武汉大学国家卓越工程师学院</span></span></p><p><span><span>编审丨党政办公室</span></span></p><p><span><span>排版丨谢慧珍</span></span></p><p><span><span>推广丨武大遥感新媒体中心</span></span></p><p><span><span>投稿丨ygxy@whu.edu.cn</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/E8NicUD0iaWrlzDB1zLksZ9zicQIpk0kqxlfm48SfZxn5CVOLgwBc240U1IW7mHGbMcFzdnHRHXlQkXS5bj9s3S6GbgCiajUicrmedEWFszW8Iwk/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>我知道你</span><span><strong><span>在看</span></strong></span><span>哟！</span></span></p></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/OB46PXRW3IZHglib6abXxkDyptkQXaBqFibOExbghlic3fvvb4fhspGma2Jh8VnMSqD8L4qibiaWtoiaXXf2gOb20iczQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><p><span>你点的每一个“</span><span><strong><span>在看</span></strong></span><span>”，珞小遥都有遥远地感知到哦~</span></p></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"c246d7341e5b6bbb7543f692638e2f2f0c05cf35e83173fcd7d68e6b258a5148","textLength":996,"sourceSha256":"5774e0dca09157deb5ab44192ab6831ca22ed81733d5262b80dbed11e9f81536","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-b006543114d297ae80e3","title":"2026年武汉大学遥感信息工程学院低空技术与经济项目中心关于举办2026年校园开放日活动的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:45.184996+00:00"}
